%% Canonical source for the blue-green-swap diagram.
%% Embedded inline in docs/architecture/07-operations.md.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Op as Operator
    participant CI as CI pipeline
    participant Reg as Image registry
    participant Ctrl as Deploy controller
    participant Old as thurward (old VM)
    participant New as thurward (new VM)
    participant Br as br-lan / br-wan

    Op->>CI: PR merged on rules-repo
    CI->>CI: reproducible build + tests
    CI->>Reg: push image, cosign sign, attach SLSA-3 provenance
    Ctrl->>Reg: pull image
    Ctrl->>Ctrl: verify cosign sig + SLSA provenance (ADR 0010)
    Ctrl->>New: start on br-lan / br-wan
    New->>Br: attach to bridges
    Ctrl->>New: confirm health (vsock metric `thurward_build_info` present)
    Ctrl->>Br: migrate 10.0.0.1 to new VM (gratuitous ARP)
    Note over Old,New: new flows hit New; established flows continue on Old
    Ctrl->>Old: wait drain window (default 300s)
    Ctrl->>Old: stop VM, detach TAPs
